    "outcome": "#523 reached head 0533c8e3 with no open findings after 12 rounds (type-argument binding feature reverted out of the bump). #527 reached 3f462a81 after round 6, and its memory-regression worry was shown to be noise. New findings were then dispatched on #527, #523 and #519, with three workers running.",
